WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.675
The sun always lights half the moon; we see different amounts of that half.

2
00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:07.975
The sun always lights half the moon.

3
00:00:11.468 --> 00:00:14.693
As it orbits, we see more or less of that lit half.

4
00:00:16.867 --> 00:00:21.092
At full moon we see the whole lit half; a cycle takes a month.
